<Positioned left="66" top="93.75999999999999" width="1780"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Maximum daily ozone-hole area, 1979–2025</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="66" top="116.25999999999999"><Text fontSize="12" color="#9FB0CCFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">The hole grew for two decades, stopped growing around the turn of the century, and has been flat-with-noise since. That is what recovery looks like from here.</Text></Positioned>
